      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 2 at% Nb will increase fracture toughness and yield strength by at least about 20% relative to the undoped alloy.",
